{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22824","headline":"初到江州寄翰林张李杜三学士 · 白居易","name":"初到江州寄翰林张李杜三学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早攀霄汉上天衢，晚落风波委世途。\n雨露施恩无厚薄，蓬蒿随分有荣枯。\n伤禽侧翅惊弓箭，老妇低颜事舅姑。\n碧落三仙曾识面，年深记得姓名无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}